Package: qore-vss-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-vss-module-doc
Description: vehicle signal loading, validation and providers for Qore
 This package provides VssLoader and VssDataProvider source and compiled
 modules, provider resources and translations. It parses Vehicle Signal
 Specification catalogs, validates telemetry, converts units and integrates
 vehicle data with Qore data providers and processing pipelines.

Package: qore-vss-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-vss-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's VSS modules
 This package contains HTML API references, example tests and sample vehicle
 signal data for VssLoader and VssDataProvider.
